    "chapter_name": "chemical coordination integration",
    "question_type": "mcq",
    "question_text": "Write short notes on the functions of the following hormones:\n(a) Parathyroid hormone (PTH)\n(b) Thyroid hormones\n(c) Thymosins\n(d) Androgens\n(e) Estrogens\n(f) Insulin and Glucagon",
    "question_latex": null,
    "mcq_options": [
